{
 "_about": [
  "The app list of the firmware: the ONE place where an app is added.",
  "main/apps_gen.py reads it at each CMake configure and writes into the build folder (build*/apps/): apps_gen.h",
  "(ARCADE_APP_<ID> 1 or 0; ID = sym without app_, in capitals), apps_list.inc (one ARCADE_APP(...) line for each",
  "app of this build), apps.cmake (the sources and the defines), apps.lf (the PSRAM .bss lines of linker.lf) and",
  "apps_built.json (what the build has). It also keeps main/apps_all.inc (all apps: host tests with no build folder).",
  "The order of apps is the menu order. The selection: the 'on' flags, or a file: idf.py -D ARCADE_SELECT=<file>.",
  "App fields: name = the menu name (the .name of the app_t); sym = the app_t symbol; group = GAMES, UTIL, SETTINGS",
  "or SYSTEM (not in the menu); on = in the main set; new = the NEW pill; core = system code calls it, it cannot",
  "leave (why_core says why); with = its app_t is in the object of that app; srcs = its own sources; uses = shared",
  "modules; needs = apps whose sources it links (they are built, but not in the menu when they are off);",
  "test349 / tests3 = the self-test tap point (logical) on the 3.49 and on the CoreS3 layout; test_ms = the self-test",
  "time (6000 when not given); emoji = the manager icon; private = not in the public repo; requires = it builds only",
  "when this file exists in main/; guard = the C switch of the app (ARCADE_HAS_*); host false = the host fuzz leaves",
  "it out; psram = its sources whose static state (.bss) goes to PSRAM;",
  "scn_ready (SCENES) = the finished scenes (scn_<key>.c, scn_<key>_data.c, SCN_HAS_<KEY>=1; psram_scenes: their",
  ".bss to PSRAM).",
  "core.srcs = the system files (always in the firmware); host_skip = the files that the host fuzz does not compile",
  "(tests/host/stubs.c has their functions); modules = shared code that an app uses; link_order = the order of the",
  "sources in the build (the order of 1.0.32; the same apps in another order made the image 5.5 KB bigger): a file",
  "that is not in it goes to the end. core.extras = the optional features of the core: each one has a Kconfig option",
  "(main/Kconfig.projbuild, menu \"TFN OS extras\"); when it is off, its srcs are not in the build (apps_gen.py)."
 ],
 "slim": {"kinds": ["cores3", "am18", "watcher", "lcd349", "tab5", "am175"], "skip": [], "keep": {}, "about": "The slim firmware: these kinds get only the core apps, and the other apps as app files from the manager store. apps_gen.py builds them so (with all modules and the scene art: ABI names), and the composer of the manager gives them only the core apps. The keeper installs on such a board the apps that it had built in before (one time, in the menu order, the board storage then the SD card), except the apps of skip."},
